        a sci:Proposition ;
        skos:prefLabel "Single-timepoint tumor CMag does not carry a directionally-reproducible luminal-breast-cancer prognostic signal — TCGA-Ueda trends adverse, METABRIC-Ueda-tertile trends protective on the same frozen index" ;
